<header>
  <h1>Abdullah Memon</h1>
  <p class="role">AI Engineer</p>
  <p>I design LLM systems for production and decide by measurement. The method is fixed before each test, the results are published including what failed, and the design changes on what they show. My work spans the stack, from model serving and retrieval to the product users see, in Python and TypeScript.</p>
  <p>On client products I also ran the servers, deployments, databases and security incidents. Each one shipped with an admin panel, role-based access and documentation, so the founder could run it without me.</p>
  <p class="meta">Hyderabad, Pakistan · Remote, UTC+5<br>You can hire me full-time on a contract through my UK company, Memon Systems Ltd, or through an employer of record.</p>
